{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1312,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f68d6526d17d76fdabb17789",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飞鹰闻我衣服的气味，\r\n就说中了我做的点心。\r\n实在让人有点害羞……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c78c65476021a5fbe41c7076697acfe793e7f1a476554e5aca9452a87cb1f81b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3f6d51f48ea4eb0ea595d44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要制作新作品，\r\n进王就一定会来试吃。\r\n是帮了大忙……但她怎么知道的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "94436cfcf97bdc1f171424296c6fd27226074ff38eef94f00264c6e85f27a6a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acbe28a880a56b05adeb39ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近会和小花交换手工饼干。\r\n吃起来非常顺口……\r\n很有疗愈感呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67083b87dcba6530a247698b202893c6fc8f1233f0d0f3e721c2883906c7e001",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02b6c6ced9b909580a55eb02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "至今所做的一切都会被加以审视，\r\n这点我相信无论是竞赛还是\r\n甜点师的工作……都是一样的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bccf87b09c057f905b38791824fb4ab22c4f4816b4b062bbc071f973c48fbe5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1844f7df6fde718f64adac79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为生日或其他特别的日子做点缀\r\n也是甜点师的工作。\r\n所以……我会用奔驰点缀竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "902efed4ee92c5d360226eb8ab65f463f103332e498756d0526c92d6b4f5ac73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12312eac16b42f1dc4920b7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上是完成\r\n当天所有准备的时间……\r\n这是甜点师的铁则。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4307adb47713e0ce18028aa3c3531b6a764b37faf7c4c2439b59aad9cc35bca5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9be58efb3c0465fb176a34c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "餐后甜点和正餐之间的零食……\r\n虽然都是点心，\r\n但要配合时间点做调整才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48cf54aac925011f2741ed13cf7262ab7d4a99dcf6094bdb1993a6f0d81dfd78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2490ae0627eede9d260bd68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Konditor……甜点师的一天\r\n可说是从夜晚开始的。\r\n毕竟要进行明天的准备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e8f2a9569d6d82ce421d8d86e9f55def95b437d528b996e0585cf213e7d065a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aee1e14b170169313ad6c30b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赏花的季节……\r\n不用白雪改用樱花的意境\r\n制作德式圣诞面包或许也不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b345ef871fd46710c08b93dfa5c108d48e7e621131c39a4cdd637986a27f4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a25a7537535e409dd2221b4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要去德国旅行建议夏天前往。\r\n有机会的话让我带你去观光。\r\n行程安排还请交给我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55ebdb2962f198958ef851cc5215b5e0c59724660264c08939950137e26621ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f560e8459b4e2911a7d79d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想出去捡栗子呢……\r\n我想到了一个\r\n应该会很好吃的蒙布朗食谱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c8eefd1e36ee0f93d4d9e9354cf3f6ea562d3aca09771a6b6e32ea44d6446e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1768882810d97cc2863153ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节和圣诞节……\r\n以点心为主的日子越接近，\r\n就越令人振奋呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "266f5e68940c8184723fd379932942ebda72aaa32d3f9a27835577fc82f83ca6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf4fbb1a69392f24350a8c9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "职人，原本是经历严苛的修行\r\n才能获得的称号。我希望自己能\r\n别忘记这套服装具有的意义。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb555bfda5a5ef2a9e6f1b9369619ace7a13f5d8878775f07210965d46db927c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4226a3bfc0f4a51e9bd031b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上这套服装，\r\n就会涌现面对作品的热情……\r\n有点像是竞赛开始前的心情呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2752c294a47aa4ca04d44e6914a2fff1f96773474c8bc3186732692cb2a71ad0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0696961ba76989134fea6642",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近、ウマドルについて両親に\r\n聞かれるんです。ファルコンさんの\r\nおかげで興味を持ったようで。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcd13346341b522896d1e4fadd7cdd5b8e04ecbde27000e35aa528b8c6a876e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:760456b8b17bc070259fd508",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "リッキーさんが教えてくれた運気と\r\n時間帯の関係、興味深いですね。\r\nスケジュール管理に活かせそうです",
      "source_fingerprint": "11368d8eb4bc23c1b6b91c8013022a5241469f84ba89db63495a50828c6879b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0369c32254f26d0bee2344d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "タルマエさんのウマッター、本当に\r\n苫小牧への愛に溢れているんです。\r\n地元を思う気持ち、共感できます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ab3b6d612a4b22112f52f7b8ef5da9c495166c465266b63812cbe912ccf656b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfeac1a57a76eadf82f635e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今度、漬物の交換会をやるんです。\r\nアキュートさんのぬか漬けと、\r\n私のザワークラウトを。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93021cf4c7fff8da673f62f0d832d6211eeef1bdfba1cec7ade225757ffb5f78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7d12eeeca12dbfeabe67b8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "納豆とバニラアイスを混ぜると\r\n美味しいらしいのですが…\r\n好物とはいえ、勇気がいりますね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c21ed09b03b7525fd239f38c9d51220023029f7dfcd7a614d36a199204f8fc81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1388725f7cd7016b6ee3e2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ラジオ体操は合理的ですね。\r\n3分11秒で13種類もの運動を…\r\n手軽に行える点も高評価です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f12bb23322d7f38ae3846e116be0a7da7c58306f15e6b1884395a394ff936ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe7ae44daf241f265b334169",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "水の中に潜ると、時間の流れが\r\n止まったみたいで…。少しだけ、\r\n心もとなくなってしまいますね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf4c47b93fa76f4f5bafc0f4efb508cb5968137f84a0c507d3341eb91af2ed05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39c54e95431dc29e65467cc0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よろしければ語り聞かせを\r\nいたしましょうか？貴方が\r\n眠くなるまで、グリム童話を…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "11b7d0f3252c84cafab4c46ac8a8936f7516301444c611323fc2d0d2be9dd643",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c455f965e87e6c7c585206d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "花壇でお話ししたのですが…\r\nネオユニヴァースさんも\r\nお好きなんですね、テントウムシ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "947c7170804313241cc90c1d732ca03d3f283e91162db0b73bb8e66945753bad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4f6063d778eaf99f2643f6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏といえば、両親と過ごした湖畔の\r\nロッジを思い出します。3人一緒に\r\nハンモックでお昼寝したりして…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6f1b50780fdcb5d9d66334fcd94c8a6c421df41d12c9c634f9f99c87d93e1f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a71f098aec40301abcd43648",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "日本のかぼちゃ祭りも行ってみたい\r\nですね。ドイツだと、くり抜いた\r\nかぼちゃで川下りをするんですよ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e93fbe895f4fe49cdbe1f3197bed0201440de72246caec90a49778c7eb0d8f6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9332e93d353e104b27180e14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "恐ろしいですね、こたつ…。\r\n予定があるからと急かしても、\r\nファルコンさんったら亀のように…",
      "source_fingerprint": "f73750c0f13b4a249fc1164d5548f64a8be11ebf56788802aa8c522b4e26d43a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6aca4b4301772d8cf0bd9d38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この耳飾り、ルナフラッシュが\r\n使われているんです。主な効果は\r\n『感情の察知』…らしいですよ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e007f720ecefde1fe2fab5010c9208a810950b7fbc4dc97a33f2d117f88d6365",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9032d5b259cdefcf05a0d69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "水着に合わせて、ネイルも施して\r\nみました。夏の青空をイメージ\r\nしたのですが…どうでしょうか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4150c2691618d7937429161eceb225172dc8bdbe310cb4993c2bdc688c0688c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1caea9b1da27ca2176ad7a5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们一起朝目标迈进吧。\r\n首先要先拟定好计划才行呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0c9290c50253919350a668c7d13deacf2f91956969dd2dfa3f4bef24bc3c1b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8263d524d91f937d1eab2ded",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いきます……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8b7db84f06d3b8c3e77990bfb56fbba00a26176992743740345b9ae0ae5f420",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b2f3365d2a8eb108378c1bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "确认过了行程，好。\r\n来开始度过今天吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b29f580743b43207586e619e9189bc60b8c6ec3807f5349ed1bd0f0ca550178",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b522fba971b871d0d7d3cbcf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论距离目标有多遥远，\r\n只要确实拟定好计划，\r\n我就能朝着目标持续前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "681f5b0b56478f380ac64e677d38684b993b7466300a907a767d8848a0e0ec48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f859344af60d3be93dfffde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经做好了事前的准备。\r\n接下来就烦请你指导了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d215effdd41b302e4cdcea7b0ec5db000956cbd75b06085a3abe112db05cd3da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ecf82b60df097294db6f3ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和你一起就能完成目标……\r\n我如此深信着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6774921e85fdeb6bab222e6b8c14a6cda47e764c5f50b941420553ac39147111",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd75ad128d23ccf512ed5d87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们一起来拟定计划吧。\r\n我很相信你的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8341bdd1fc7ada66d1275168e2dbb07f617d39e0f5d37210b594c87ea1c5fda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d80b842cdc6f0610416d4d39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果你发现我有什么做不好的地方，\r\n请不要客气，一定要指正我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c93f3bd048e8abbbfd371e3156269032716f044002e739cfc33153075171251c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d98aabd0658ad69ba60c4d9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还真是新奇……\r\n因为在德国，\r\n比起海水浴更流行湖水浴嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f69bdb28c243d3c01e6853df5907d9140472c1145366a8af54784442665c651f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ddffa3cdc88f80bc6cfbbc0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做好万全准备了。\r\n那么，öffnen……开店吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "186ad216d935d3c17e74682d184630dce79ffc2ce21f8d7882d138d1b05d1ae6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:974b94fe220293a8a606497e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使在竞赛中……\r\n我也一定要达到大师级的境界。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e242c2a7f74899b853ee62c031d00034f64303533e49d922516d766ff42ee25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fe6b10c7bd40135b45b109d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要精准地做好每一个步骤，\r\n直到完成名为胜利的作品。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c287755f562afe8b78cc2da1e2038a8c0a10030dfc324b21e0a8e7feab12c476",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:171112fac71d8c6c4836d1be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "兼具美味和营养……\r\n让人感受到乳清蛋白饼干\r\n丰富的可能性。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32bbd0665907dee1ae729ccc80b70673c3d98377a75d33a06206b5c283c9ebce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bf6238ddecd0fe30e2c4b5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在先集中精神全力以赴……\r\n结束后，\r\n再一起享受美味的甜点吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e20c3622b91fd8c05cff0abc62daef7fe2f2b056a8fbea22f5eb800fc20b7101",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b478ba0c9fdcbf25253fa5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了让训练员也能\r\n一起品尝胜利的滋味，\r\n不可欠缺事前准备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f8d7dcd9a228ec0053e86ad19da20c15794b2cf41f14abaf886739cfdd2895e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19b5708967b215c6b8820dd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "希望能互助合作，\r\n缔造出最棒的结果呢──\r\n就像父母在厨房那样合作无间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccc2d8bdd3991d0009b2af6e1cd7f8004b636874e9673ba83a618a02c11e09f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0146eb113836568af254b608",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "準備体操、完了しました。\r\nいつでも始められます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a2e08de296b0541742f27491a41f06209aa57bf3a531a172586602546eb4055",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "92215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77d8753249808e26008b1375",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この服装であれば、\r\nどれだけ汗をかいても大丈夫かと。\r\n水分補給の用意も万全です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16c3a00638a8ea6b733135c96e3a8e3dfd9d4743c0bbafba66ed4af164115545",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "92216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d53a82f0b2c5272d83b43222",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "輝かしい勝利を目指しましょう。\r\n思考は冷静に。ですが、\r\n心は真夏の太陽のように…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6859e460520507e34a0d081eb75a3e811162f70c48e8456fecf9d20af39c02ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "92217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cd8596fc24f33fd5d5d0c38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝利へ向けたスケジュール、\r\n必ずや厳守で参りましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1924f005dd3cf6d1e08fe4e67f08b3fe55865fbe8c88e879bf895235e428d61e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "92218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b54973ea13b1d679a2ef03d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーニングもリフレッシュ休暇も\r\n全力を尽くすつもりです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fd9b6e459172b4f63faaaebc02a4db4909756184b6ae0dc55edcae7ed31b633",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "92220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f58e5a19a464bafce97f816",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "貴方と一緒だと、いい具合に\r\n力が抜けますね。任せられる\r\n安心感…とでも言いましょうか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a12a80be9d37fe1645a8fbb5eaca21823a9c8ce8515f4fd4d46818db5bb849b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "92221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f769acd61b22aa4ec99a16f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全て伝えずとも、最良の結果が\r\nついてくる…貴方となら、どんな\r\n荒波も乗り越えられそうです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bad2d7b56ffd0d3807c61419662f54f78e9b362a71a950bab73544bcba94b77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "92222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0400ac1a7b74549c3dc42c03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我真心为现在的自己感到自豪……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a905630d8026b51af3d3ab69381185106c3802b5e63f683140704b6de2a4085",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c853587dc390d6e32ae2421d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "单凭我自己一个人的力量，\r\n是无法走到这一步的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f93b415c2ad5ed83eff215680822303bd96c60255ca4581d85aae1223198c552",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:079fe3bd5084756ed14659e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是至今为止最甜美……最幸福的心情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "18b4f56833ec66f68f0dcba3e307041ed59bca65f05b7ca150ae59ab8e15f7aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aeb805b97f147672ec237642",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是否也成为一个优秀的大师了呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b3ee5187d4e3d5747e5a377ed9a931acd4b65be88b9accfa1dfea61a1035899",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f30a9e48364d2ced7679240",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "貴方のおかげで、夏の煌めきのような\r\n日々を過ごせました…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "186c9d59c77c1686af6afe39cd23b6b49a0a8eb49cea322d19ba2862c507e0d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "93204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd548802feb58cbdb50e3e13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "荒波を越えた先の景色は、\r\n素晴らしいですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7bea53b7516838d818ec367cc82d4cab88da913a38ac39589de76a5b64035cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "93205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31554f55cfd061ddb58b8f61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "确实地……一步步朝目标前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "42ef777b05e426764c5545c48e8a7406f6c0390fec79194ddf87912e6f3677f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7828647beaa54adec872500e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝理想中的自己踏步迈进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7d2beca860fc070143b19b21be6986d543efc417531cf1160a91d06709a1cec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:477406be83f173a37dc189bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是荣进闪耀。\r\n一起拿下能让彼此自豪的胜利吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd5c9f81b4b22cbb5f5a0ca0d60b5f3f2775facb85b78a3b5eba5f2972e48c9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e18393cd781bbf483eb98483",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "完美的规划才是通往胜利的道路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cb09cd67a4dda55d19059daed250b01549372d9761d0314543f99049eb688a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fbbdab161af22a4e12acde9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我来帮忙。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fa38915247b6dd553cd9e6a733df2c202627534653b72617a55839edc3e8782",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce35af8ac449343809ea8fb8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你想要有更缜密的管理吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "46d7884a8be69c601eb5bcbb891dde3723810c12559235a5e1df1509476df542",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e47e9eae52eedbb8f14a1eb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每天修练就能精益求精。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bfd3ed71fc2affe91e24c63f79566ef9e48166f208e81cd5b3ed92445bcce2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:012347c1a24a54c10870996a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我能感受到\r\n身为职人的新境界了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c58986137b97c028bf86ff547f79a55610cd1fb8b164fa9f6ec4e20f2b3e5f3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:984876b4c90754f430e3122d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真心与细心，轻妙与玄妙。\r\n敬请享受……从未体验过的滋味。",
      "source_fingerprint": "738759b3724711354a708fe1d3d3adbc22060b581ff132570ca04c74d45128dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1aec72dca1cbd5d4b353d508",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是荣进闪耀。\r\n为您献上努力钻研出的最佳滋味。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8eea330a24953ee979ad003f929748703459439617bfb7127c0ba7caa70dc37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:380a5f2d40ffffb9abf7d270",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "リフレッシュにも全力を注いだ成果です！",
      "source_fingerprint": "60590770982a31b83f1f439c872babc48c49c2ace2d7e02175775a08a0b5bff2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "95207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:717e7cfe31e0f7fc72f1c9da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏の青空のように高く、\r\nどこまでも！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e4b484f70a9b3ade62b6a51ddf72858b6e7594d95ca337715d9da31e32920f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "95208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cb120e16fabc254504b5422",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "バカンスのスケジュール…\r\n一緒に立てませんか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef39f649b6260b07cf46cabe8a55e131c81017ab799e98db9837f6d91bc256f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "95209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad46ac1b73f8066b25f3fd5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "エイシンフラッシュです。\r\nバカンスのスケジュールも完璧です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80854a2c089ac80a401ff90d6aabe985e6ddcb5b1982024afe254c4f0d4c574f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "95210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3370ba4c1c86573d8f9b0014",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们走吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "87acf7dceacc0060a2d9da85debd02a2d7310f7a0402644ad624c55b6ef33803",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a172f4eb4b3169df2aaea610",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "受到全世界……不，受到全宇宙喜爱\r\n就会变得最可爱。\r\n哥哥，你也要爱我哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c28e75d61ec6d67509830d7a3ebe60b8c332815534049d8325bf70992c148165",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:430e0d582291906ea73cd8f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってきまーす☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9554a7ec84bc3060e1bf89170ba3d4c0147a88775dd2f19a17da0e7c9dab4109",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9452c39f6ebb31b38623c5b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "12e9b8603d755c993113acb8d5a78b4dac41954ef6a61b70226702a5551b5516",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9f729df538dd229374486c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，你刚刚在看机伶对吧？\r\n啊哈，如果是哥哥你～\r\n可以靠更近一点……也没关系呀♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "449f67869a04653c5a7fbda9c90393ba7b8d85a6e0e6f10170a7f0ed8fef7e59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60f508ff4111b9e73f378726",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果想更了解机伶，\r\n就直接开口看看吧。\r\n那样说不定……我会告诉你哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8c3dacfb7fa05e51749a0bc7a859562898990b9bd403d6f0be643124372dc75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c651a9851f61f59811f087b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐♪\r\n今年也要好好疼爱\r\n机伶哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1a1c75d44ab6a0624f11d5b70d1d3b8611b67be85f7fa10eab620ed769e1408",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2aca12602736ae04d9d2f7cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你想要巧克力还是机伶？\r\n……开玩笑的啦～机伶对哥哥来说\r\n可能还太早了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc19446cca564246620ea2abf1a9494515596f65110e7afcbe8260848fc35aa8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f297237f759e8badea86d62f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不要送哥哥巧克力，\r\n而是送我整个人好了～♪\r\n……你可以当真没关系哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8828ff3c09c8ba495a6492d11d970b27b1cb8f08da55d6d94e3901bdd413e34d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10005"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
